OL,3,GNEWSAZoo boss calls pipeline plan on
OL,4,Asite 'unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChester Zoo's chief executive has said
OL,7,Fplans to build an underground pipeline
OL,8,Fthat will cut through wildlife and
OL,9,Fhabitats on the site are
OL,10,F"unacceptable".
OL,12,FThe zoo has 470 acres (about 190
OL,13,Fhectares) of land just outside its main
OL,14,Fsite, which make up a regional
OL,15,Fconservation and habitat recovery
OL,16,Fprogramme.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
