OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAZoo boss calls pipeline plan on
OL,4,Asite 'unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FZoo boss James Christon said
OL,7,Fconservation efforts were under threat
OL,8,Ffrom the Peak Cluster Project - a plan
OL,9,Ffor a pipeline through the North West
OL,10,Fto transport carbon emissions to the
OL,11,Fcoastline. He said the current route
OL,12,F"would rip through our fields and
OL,13,Fjeopardise environmentally sensitive
OL,14,Fhabitats".
OL,16,FPeak Cluster chief executive David
OL,17,FParkin said the firm remained committed
OL,18,Fto working with the zoo.
